  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot project to maintain and/or enhance the energy efficiency of replacement technologies and equipment in the context of HFC phase-down</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the pilot project is to strengthen and improve the national system for energy efficiency in the RAC sector, in line with EU MEPS and energy efficiency design, while promoting the adoption of measures and technologies that ensure sustained energy savings and reduced emissions of controlled substances.</narrative>
